OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with clear spells and
OL,7,Fturning quite chilly in sheltered
OL,8,Fglens. High cloud will spread east
OL,9,Ffrom the late evening with rain and
OL,10,Fdrizzle following around morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA cloudy start with rain and
OL,13,Fdrizzle soon clearing east. The rest
OL,14,Fof the day will stay dry with
OL,15,Fincreasing sunny periods. Feeling warm
OL,16,Fin the sunshine.
